    "modifications": [
      "PR89: buffer initial MCP tool notifications before App.connect, drain after React handler registration.",
      "Initialize fullscreen from the negotiated host context and buffer early context changes until React handler registration.",
      "Self-contained dependency and font assets; native system font fallback replaces optional Xiaolai CJK font without changing text.",
      "Canonical full-scene image/appState persistence, acknowledged chunked save/retry/flush via standard MCP tools.",
      "Public aiEnabled=false additionally gates manual Mermaid menu and Mermaid paste paths; optional converter branch excluded.",
      "One host-context subscription applies negotiated mobile safe-area insets to floating controls in both canonical and legacy editors, without padding or resizing the canvas.",
      "Apply negotiated top/right safe-area insets to the pinned mobile Library/lock/hand panel in both editors so it cannot cover the toolbar; place the legacy compact Export beside that panel without overlapping either toolbar; canvas dimensions and Library visibility remain unchanged.",
      "Consume the validated Zoen floating close rectangle in both editors; only floating top controls clear its corner, while the canvas, actual safe-area insets, and document state keep their full frame.",
      "Split maintained legacy MCP editor by responsibility into chrome, streaming SVG preview, scene conversion/viewport helpers and host lifecycle; preserve the pinned upstream revision and runtime behavior."
    ],
